# Legal Clay Local AI Core

This module contains the local FastAPI-driven agent and security layer for the Legal Clay App.

## Included components
- `agents/` for agent abstractions and legal auditing workflows
- `skills/` for sanitization, document conversion, and security analysis
- `routers/` for REST API routes
- `core/` for provider abstractions and shared runtime helpers

## Local startup

```bash
cd local-ai
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload
```

## Endpoints
- `GET /health`
- `POST /api/v1/agents/audit-text`
- `POST /api/v1/agents/audit-document`

